	(text "D920 SMBJ26A sits VM -> GND, NOT across the coil: the bridge has integral body diodes, so the coil freewheels inside the part and the only real risk is supply pumping (1/2 L I^2 = 1.8 mJ into 100 uF from 15 V = 1.2 V rise). The clamp must fire below the DRV8871's 45 V maximum, which is why the brief's SMBJ58A is wrong here."
